<title>SWEDEN: Trygg-Hansa sells Protectum unit.</title>
<headline>Trygg-Hansa sells Protectum unit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish insurer Trygg-Hansa on Monday said it was selling its loss protection unit Protectum to independent consultancy company Unirisk Ltd that specialises in risk management.</p>
<p>Trygg-Hansa said Protectum has a unique centre of knowledge in risk management, an advanced heavy goods simulator, a cargo securing simulator and a fire laboratory.</p>
<p>&quot;Through the agreement more extensive groups of customers will have access to this facility,&quot; company spokesman Mats Hoglund said in a statement.</p>
<p>No financial details of the transaction were released.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
